      "claim": "The driver's asserted external event is unevidenced, and the one artifact that could settle it — a traffic advisory for the BKE corridor — is missing and flagged BLOCKING. POL-RD-10 is addressed to precisely this situation: a traffic excuse asserted with no traffic_advisory is a matter the tribunal cannot resolve on the papers, and the disposition the policy prescribes is escalation rather than a final money ruling. Under POL-GEN-03 an ESCALATE is terminal and holds the disputed SGD 7.00 rather than collecting or refunding it, so it is the only disposition available on this record that leaves the rider not carrying the disputed charge while the driver's justification is tested.",
